  m_Name: Rock 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  line: We are one mind, made of many rocks. Given power by the sacred cliffs, we
    can rise. By finding harmonious arrangements, we can listen to the world's natural
    energy, and gain knowledge.
  option1:
    text: How are you speaking to me?
